# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

Attaches a single MinIO IAM user to one or more IAM groups. This resource ensures the user is a member of **exactly** the groups specified—any groups not listed will be removed. Groups added by `minio_iam_group_membership` or `minio_iam_group_user_attachment` are removed on the next apply. Manage a user's groups with this resource or with one of those two, never with more than one of the three at once.


